        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When an employee is ordered for night standby duties, the compensation will be double time, either in compensatory time off or in cash, at the discretion of the employee, for the hours worked with a minimum of four (4) hours per pay or compensatory time. For weekend standby, in addition, the compensation shall be one full day, to be paid in cash or in time off. This provision shall apply to the employees engaged in air pollution control and hospital technicians.",
