        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees who are regularly scheduled to work a shift commencing after the normal 9:00 A.M. to 5:00 P.M. shift will receive an additional thirty cents ($0.30) per hour for all hours worked after 3:00 P.M.",
