        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Such shift bonus will be applied to all absences from the employee's regularly assigned shift except for vacations and extended periods of absence. Should an employee be absent from the regularly scheduled shift, the absent time paid will include the appropriate shift bonus; however, after eight consecutive work days absent, sick absence will be paid according to the regular day shift rate.",
