        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Compensation shall be at time and one-half (1 1/2) the hourly rate for work performed over forty (40) hours per week, except where otherwise specified herein. The department will extend every effort to distribute overtime as equitably as possible and will keep records quarterly concerning overtime worked. Such records will be made available to employees upon reasonable request.",
