            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. An employee may refuse overtime as long as said refusal does not work a hardship on the department concerned as determined by the department head. If an employee refuses the overtime, the hours refused shall be charged as time worked, for the purpose of overtime equalization.",
            "block_bbox": [
                886,
