        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Each employee covered under this Agreement, who is called into work and who is presently receiving a call-in guarantee of four (4) hours per day at the applicable straight or overtime rate, shall continue to receive such guarantee. Each employee who is not covered under such guarantee and who is called into work shall receive a minimum of two (2) hours per day at the applicable straight time or overtime rate. The above call-in provision shall be effective between the end of the employ-ce's regular shift on a work day until the beginning of the employee's next regular shift on the next work day. The call-in provisions as stated above renew themselves each time an employee is called into work. If an employee works beyond the call-in time set forth herein, the employee shall continue to be paid for all such hours or part thereof worked at the straight time or overtime rate whichever is applicable.",
